#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:898
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_WroteSecretCodeLockOpened"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} wrote down the secret code\n"
"on the door.\p"
"“TRICK MASTER is a genius.”\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"The lock clicked open!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}在门上写下了暗号。\p"
"“机关大王是天才。”\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"咔嚓一声，锁打开了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:905
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll1Intro"
msgid ""
"CLICKETY-CLACK…\n"
"MECHADOLL 1 AM I!\p"
"IF YOU ANSWER QUIZZES CORRECTLY,\n"
"THEN YOU WILL GO TO MECHADOLL 5.\l"
"THEN YOU CAN OBTAIN THE SECRET CODE.$"
msgstr ""
"咔嗒咔嗒……我乃机关人偶1号！\p"
"答对测验题的话，就可以去机关人\n"
"偶5号那里。然后就能得到暗号。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:912
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll1Quiz1"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 1 QUIZ.\p"
"One of these POKéMON is not found\n"
"on ROUTE 110. Which one is it?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶1号的测验。\p"
"下面这些宝可梦中，有一只在\n"
"110号道路上找不到。是哪一只呢？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:917
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll1Quiz2"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 1 QUIZ.\p"
"One of these POKéMON is not of the\n"
"WATER type. Which one is it?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶1号的测验。\p"
"下面这些宝可梦中，\n"
"有一只不是水属性。是哪一只呢？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:922
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll1Quiz3"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 1 QUIZ.\p"
"One of these POKéMON does not use\n"
"LEECH LIFE. Which one is it?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶1号的测验。\p"
"下面这些宝可梦中，\n"
"有一只不会使用吸血。是哪一只呢？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:927
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_CorrectGoThrough"
msgid ""
"CONGRATULATIONS. CORRECT YOU ARE.\n"
"GO THROUGH. PLEASE.$"
msgstr "恭喜。你答对了。请通过。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:931
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_DisappointmentError"
msgid ""
"BZZZT. DISAPPOINTMENT.\n"
"ERROR.$"
msgstr "哔哔哔。好失望。错误。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:935
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Wahahahaha"
msgid ""
"WAHAHAHAHA! WAHAHAHAHA!\n"
"CLICKETY-CLACK!$"
msgstr "哇哈哈哈哈！哇哈哈哈哈！咔嗒咔嗒！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:939
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_WaitForNextChallenge"
msgid "YOUR NEXT CHALLENGE WE WAIT FOR.$"
msgstr "你的下一次挑战，我们等待着。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:942
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll2Intro"
msgid ""
"CLICKETY-CLACK…\n"
"MECHADOLL 2 AM I!\p"
"MECHADOLL 1'S QUIZ DIFFICULTY LEVEL\n"
"IS SET TOO LOW.$"
msgstr ""
"咔嗒咔嗒……我乃机关人偶2号！\p"
"机关人偶1号的测验难度设定得太低了。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:948
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll2Quiz1"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 2 QUIZ.\p"
"Which of these POKéMON did WALLY\n"
"borrow from your father?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶2号的测验。\p"
"满充向你爸爸借的是下面哪一只宝可梦？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:953
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll2Quiz2"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 2 QUIZ.\p"
"Which of these POKéMON was chasing\n"
"PROF. BIRCH?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶2号的测验。\p"
"追赶小田卷博士的是下面哪一只宝可梦？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:958
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll2Quiz3"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 2 QUIZ.\p"
"Which of these POKéMON did TEAM AQUA\n"
"use in PETALBURG FOREST?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶2号的测验。\p"
"海洋队在橙华森林里使用的\n"
"是下面哪一只宝可梦？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:963
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll3Intro"
msgid ""
"CLICKETY-CLACK…\n"
"MECHADOLL 3 AM I!\p"
"MATTERS OF MONEY ARE MY SOLE FOCUS.$"
msgstr ""
"咔嗒咔嗒……我乃机关人偶3号！\p"
"我只关心和钱有关的问题。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:968
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll3Quiz1"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 3 QUIZ.\p"
"Which costs more?\n"
"Three HARBOR MAILS or one BURN HEAL?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶3号的测验。\p"
"3封港口邮件和1个灼伤药，哪个更贵？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:973
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll3Quiz2"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 3 QUIZ.\p"
"Sell one GREAT BALL and buy\n"
"one POTION. How much money remains?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶3号的测验。\p"
"卖掉1个超级球，\n"
"再买1个伤药。还剩下多少钱？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:978
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll3Quiz3"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 3 QUIZ.\p"
"Do one REPEL and SODA POP cost\n"
"more than one SUPER POTION?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶3号的测验。\p"
"1个除虫喷雾加1瓶劲爽汽水，\n"
"比1个好伤药更贵吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:983
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll4Intro"
msgid ""
"CLICKETY-CLACK…\n"
"MECHADOLL 4 THAT IS ME!\p"
"MY QUIZ IS AN OBJECT OF BEAUTY.$"
msgstr ""
"咔嗒咔嗒……机关人偶4号，就是我！\p"
"我的测验是美的结晶。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:988
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll4Quiz1"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 4 QUIZ.\p"
"In SEASHORE HOUSE, were there more men\n"
"or women?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶4号的测验。\p"
"海之家里，男性多还是女性多？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:993
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll4Quiz2"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 4 QUIZ.\p"
"In LAVARIDGE TOWN, were there more\n"
"elderly men or elderly women?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶4号的测验。\p"
"釜炎乡里，老爷爷多还是老婆婆多？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:998
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll4Quiz3"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 4 QUIZ.\p"
"In the TRAINER'S SCHOOL, how many\n"
"girl students were there?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶4号的测验。\p"
"训练家学校里有几名女学生？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:1003
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll5Intro"
msgid ""
"CLICKETY-CLACK…\n"
"MECHADOLL 5 AM I!\p"
"THE MASTER'S BEST AND PROUDEST\n"
"ACHIEVEMENT AM I.$"
msgstr ""
"咔嗒咔嗒……我乃机关人偶5号！\p"
"我是主人最得意、最骄傲的杰作。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:1009
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll5Quiz1"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 5 QUIZ.\p"
"In SLATEPORT's POKéMON FAN CLUB,\n"
"how many POKéMON were there?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶5号的测验。\p"
"凯那市的宝可梦爱好者俱\n"
"乐部里有几只宝可梦？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:1014
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll5Quiz2"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 5 QUIZ.\p"
"In FORTREE CITY, how many\n"
"tree houses were there?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶5号的测验。\p"
"茵郁市里有几座树屋？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5/scripts.inc:1019
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll5Quiz3"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 5 QUIZ.\p"
"On the CYCLING ROAD, how many\n"
"TRIATHLETES were there?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶5号的测验。\p"
"自行车道上有几名铁人三项运动员？$"
